---
/** The terms of use, the same for every site: they are one service. */
import Content from '../layouts/Content.astro';
import Credit from './Credit.astro';
import { COPY, SITES, type Topic } from '@isithot/core';
import { siteNames } from '../lib/topics';

interface Props {
  topic: Topic;
}
const { topic } = Astro.props;
const site = SITES[topic].name;
---

<Content
  title="Terms"
  path="/terms"
  description={`Terms of use for ${site}. Forecasts are estimates and not for safety-critical decisions.`}
  topic={topic}
>
  <h1>Terms</h1>
  <p>
    <em>Draft for review. Last updated 14 October 2026.</em>
  </p>
  <p>{siteNames(topic)} are one service, and these terms cover all four.</p>

  <h2>Forecasts are estimates</h2>
  <p>
    The sites summarise computer forecasts from several weather models. Forecasts can be wrong, and
    "hot", "wet", "snow" and "windy" are judgements, not measurements. The sites do not issue
    weather warnings. Do not rely on them for safety-critical decisions, including heat health,
    flooding, strong winds, outdoor work, travel or events. Follow advice from your national weather
    service and health authorities.
  </p>

  <h2>Use of the sites</h2>
  <p>
    Please use the sites and their API reasonably. Do not scrape them in bulk with automated tools
    or send requests in volumes that put a heavy load on them. Requests are rate-limited, and we may
    limit or block heavy use.
  </p>

  <h2>Data and credits</h2>
  <p>
    <Credit text={COPY.forecastCredit} />: the answers and blended figures are our own work.
    <Credit text={COPY.metOfficeCredit} />. Climate data from NASA POWER (CC BY 4.0). Place names
    from GeoNames (CC BY 4.0). The data stays under its own licences, and nothing in these terms
    limits what those licences allow. Links to BBC Weather, the Met Office and AccuWeather are
    provided for convenience; we are not affiliated with them.
  </p>

  <h2>Liability</h2>
  <p>
    The sites are provided as is, without warranties. To the extent the law allows, we are not
    liable for losses arising from their use.
  </p>
</Content>
